# Meridian Combine: human corporate. Massive clean white blocks, slate panels, a safety-orange
# band at shoulder height and a teal corporate stripe. Cold white light. Two module sets:
# "lab" for buried research sites and "ship" for the hull sections of a downed freighter.

kit meridian
name Meridian Combine
faction meridian
light e6f2ff

panels 12 4 0.15
facade 4a4f58 3a4250 e0a800

palette
  #  cube     concrete  e6e1d6|dcd6ca         wall    clean white blocks
  %  cube     alloy     3a4250|353c49         wall    slate panels
  a  cube     alloy     c8ccd2|bfc4ca|d2d5da  wall    hull plating
  _  cube     concrete  4a4f58|50555e         floor
  =  cube     concrete  d4cfc4|cdc8bc         roof
  *  cube     lumen     e6f2ff                light   cold white panels
  w  pane     glass     9fd3e0                window
  k  cube     alloy     ef6c1a                decor   safety-orange band
  t  cube     alloy     1f8a8a                decor   teal corporate stripe
  o  pillar   alloy     3a4250                wall
  m  machine  alloy     59606e|4e5562         decor   machinery
  y  cube     steel     e0a800|1e1e1e         decor   hazard blocks
  c  pod      lumen     8fd8ff                decor   cryo cradles
  b  bunk     cloth     4f6d7a                decor   crew bunks
  e  cube     lumen     ff8a3a                light   engine glow
  /  ramp     steel     5a606a                floor
  u  cube     concrete  3a3f48                floor

